# perf3: common prefix for the FAST / NOFAST comparison (a) (b): the first idle (wizard shown), 7 snapshots every 250 virtual ms (decision 0142: converged at 1.75 s), three more, then Enter and four snapshots of the closing animation.
snap wiz0
advance 250
snap a0250
advance 250
snap a0500
advance 250
snap a0750
advance 250
snap a1000
advance 250
snap a1250
advance 250
snap a1500
advance 250
snap a1750
advance 250
snap a2000
advance 1000
snap a3000
advance 1000
snap a4000
tap 13
advance 300
snap e0300
advance 1000
snap e1300
advance 1000
snap e2300
advance 1000
snap e3300
end
